          "id": "f6630e3f30bd188d3c9a1167c4f4ab79a93b6876",
          "message": "chore: synchronize ai agent config with pyproject-template (merges PR #21)\n\nSecond of three PRs syncing to template main (d80ce96), per #7. Wires\nClaude, Codex, Copilot and Antigravity per the template and removes\nGemini.\n\nTemplate improvements adopted:\n- 31 shared skills in .agents/skills (implement-issue, multi-*,\n  review/adversarial-review self-actions and delegate bridges,\n  checkpoint/restore, triage skills, rule skills) with Claude copies\n  generated by the new `doit skills_sync`\n- .claude: CLAUDE.md (replaces claude.md), settings.json with the\n  statusline, env defaults, ruff-fix-on-edit, precompact checkpoint\n  and session-resume hooks, review commands, implement-worker agent,\n  rule files\n- .codex: template config.toml (replaces an invalid TOML file) and\n  gh exec-policy rules\n- Copilot hooks, instructions and skills; Antigravity hooks.json\n- tools/hooks/ai: updated dangerous-command hook (heredoc scanning),\n  bash-ban-raw-tools, ruff-fix, checkpoint/resume, and the unwired\n  context-mode and cbm add-on hooks; tools/statusline scripts\n- AI docs: docs/development/AI_SETUP.md, docs/development/ai/*,\n  ADRs 9005, 9018, 9019, 9023, 9024, 9025\n- AGENTS.md and .github/CONTRIBUTING.md from the template, with a\n  bastproxy project-context section in AGENTS.md\n- tests for skills, roster contract, hooks, statusline, model pins\n\nbastproxy adjustments:\n- pytest pythonpath gains tests/ and mypy ignores the bare\n  `agent_roster` import, because tests/ is a package here\n- RUF100 ignored for adopted tests/test_*.py (noqa for disabled rules)\n- removed .gemini/ and the stale root AI_SETUP.md\n\nModel pins kept as the template ships them; bump requested upstream\nin endavis/pyproject-template#1035.\n\nPart of #7\nCloses #10",
